    old "February 17th, 2010."
    new "17 de fevereiro de 2010."

    old "The small Russian village of Tigoryakhovgrad, bordering North Korea."
    new "A pequena aldeia russa de Tigoryakhovgrad, na fronteira com a Coreia do Norte."

    old "Up until that point, my entire life had been nothing but war."
