    old "With my last breath, I saw the boat vanishing into the mist."
    new "Com meu último suspiro, vi o barco desaparecendo na névoa."

    old "And... I smiled."
    new "E... eu sorri."

    old "Because that day, even as I died, I had finally done something right."
    new "Porque naquele dia, mesmo quando morri, finalmente fiz algo certo."

